{"unit_id":"wang-bool__visual-review#card-zh","repo":"wang-bool/visual-review","commit":"0e2a4a6c2cbee9667b544e57f0232b2cc7ddcc21","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"visual-review 是面向 DSH Web 的图片显示与视觉理解插件。客户端会把会话中的图片渲染在聊天内容中，Host 端将图片转换为附件注解，并注册图片解读和配置工具。解读工具可分析会话附件或本地图片，按配置优先调用兼容 OpenAI 的云端多模态接口，未配置时使用本机 Qwen3-VL worker。适合需要在 DSH 对话中查看或询问图片内容的用户；云端方式需要配置服务地址、密钥和模型，本机方式需要 Python 及本地模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:622-705","lib/client.js:20-67","server/visual_review_server.py:89-119"]}
{"unit_id":"wang-bool__visual-review#card-en","repo":"wang-bool/visual-review","commit":"0e2a4a6c2cbee9667b544e57f0232b2cc7ddcc21","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"visual-review displays chat images in DSH Web and analyzes session attachments or local files. It prefers a configured OpenAI-compatible vision endpoint, otherwise using a local Qwen3-VL worker. Cloud use needs an endpoint, key, and model; local use needs Python and model files.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:622-705","lib/client.js:20-67","server/visual_review_server.py:89-119"]}
